@startuml plantuml_xkcd_handwritten
' Same kind of sequence as plantuml_sequence.puml but rendered with the
' "handwritten" skin and the xkcd Script font that ships in the image.
' This is the XKCD-style mode for PlantUML.
'
' NOTE: handwritten is enabled via the preprocessor directive `!option`,
' NOT the deprecated `skinparam handwritten true` (which embeds a warning
' watermark in the rendered SVG in modern PlantUML).

!option handwritten true
skinparam defaultFontName "xkcd Script"
skinparam backgroundColor #fffff8
skinparam shadowing false

title What happens when the build is broken

actor Developer    as dev
participant "CI"   as ci
participant "Test\nSuite" as tests
participant "Slack\nBot"  as bot

dev -> ci   : push commit
ci  -> tests: run
tests --> ci: 1 failure
ci  -> bot  : :rotating_light: build broken
bot -> dev  : DM "did you mean it?"
dev -> ci   : revert
ci  -> tests: re-run
tests --> ci: green
ci  -> bot  : :tada: green again
bot -> dev  : "phew"
@enduml
